<title>CHINA: Shanghai Posts issues 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Posts issues 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Posts and Telecommunications Equipment will distribute a 0.10 yuan cash dividend and three-for-10 bonus issue from 1996 net profits and capital reserves, a company statement said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The cash dividend for B shares will be calculated at an exchange rate of 8.2922 yuan to the U.S. dollar, the statement in the Shanghai Securities News said.</p>
<p>Trading of its A and B shares will be suspended this morning and will resume this afternoon, the statement said.</p>
<p>The registration date for A shares will be July 8 and for B shares July 11, it said.</p>
<p>The bonus issue for A shares will list on July 9 and its foreign currency B bonus shares will list on July 14, it added.</p>
</text>
